  "graded_on": "alias_floor_20k_db",
  "method": "Sum of every FFT bin more than two bins from a harmonic of the tone and from DC, against the fundamental's bin; rectangular window, no zero padding, a whole number of cycles in the transform (101 at 1010 Hz, 370 at 3700 Hz) so every harmonic lands on a bin. This is Overdrive T7's own stated method. `alias_floor_db` is the same rule with no band limit (out to Nyquist), from tools/effect_measurements.py's spectrum().",
